#
# Cross-platform 4-level page table infrastructure with 4KB granule. On x86-64
# this maps to PML4/PDPT/PD/PT loaded via CR3. On AArch64 this maps to L0/L1/L2/L3
# loaded via TTBR0_EL1. Data structures and index extraction are identical across
# architectures; only TLB flush uses arch-block asm.
